## Creating custom actions
In a Java Kanzi Engine plugin you can create custom actions with custom property types.
Kanzi Studio groups message types in the create context menu based on the value of the `EditorInfo.displayName` property of the parent class metadata where you declare the message type. You can override this information by setting the `EditorInfo.category` property.
To create a custom action:
1. In the plugin project create a class.
For example, create a class named `LogAction`.
